---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Bad Smells from AC | AC Repair Wake Forest NC" description="Musty, burning, or foul odors from your air conditioner in Rolesville and Wake Forest.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Bad Smells from AC</h1>
      <p>Musty, burning, or foul odors from your air conditioner in Rolesville and Wake Forest.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Musty smells usually indicate mold or mildew in the drain pan, coils, or ducts. Burning smells can signal electrical issues or overheating motors. Both deserve prompt attention.</p>
      <p>We inspect the indoor unit, clean biological growth when present, check electrical components, and advise on duct cleaning if needed.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Don't wait in the heat. Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day diagnosis and repair in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding areas.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>